	(text "CELL MODULE A: CELLS 1 TO 7\nEach cell: 18650 holder, red (+) / black (-) test loops, and a zero-drain\nreverse-insertion indicator (R -> LED -> 1N4148WS). It only conducts if the cell is\nfitted backwards, so it draws nothing in normal use."
